# The build context is the repo root for both images. Keeping the runtime
# state and the fixtures out of it means the layer cache survives an ingest:
# var changes on every run, and its mtime alone would invalidate the build.
.git
var
docs
testdata
deploy
scripts
mise.toml
sqlc.yaml
# The UI is rebuilt inside the image; a host's own install and build would
# only bloat the context.
web/node_modules
internal/webui/dist
